    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests for {@link MutableClock}. <p> The tests are grouped by the area of behaviour they exercise: <ul> <li>Factory methods ({@code of}, {@code epochUTC})</li> <li>Mutation operations ({@code setInstant}, {@code add}, {@code set})</li> <li>Time-zone handling ({@code getZone}, {@code withZone}, {@code instant})</li> <li>Equality and hashing (including the \"shared updates\" contract)</li> <li>String representation</li> <li>Serialization</li> <li>Thread-safety</li> </ul>"
   },
